/**
 * Go Siargao catalog.
 *
 * The place catalog is now the real, GPS-tagged **General Luna directory**
 * (367 places, `src/data/directory.ts`, generated by
 * `node scripts/build-directory.js`). This module layers the app's editorial
 * surfaces (featured hero, Discover collections, itinerary, events, filter
 * chips, "facts") on top of that catalog, always referencing real slugs so the
 * whole app stays in sync with the data.
 */

